[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1]
Eureka!

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1_desc]
Somehow, the pillars including Star Swirl the Bearded has escaped from Canterlot and disappeared.
Most ponies believe that they are dead, but there are also many conspiracy theorists who believe that the pillars are still alive and secretly helping ponies and other creatures to fight against the Big Three. Anyway, no pony has seen them yet.
But just a few days ago, we found traces of the pillars, and only some manuscripts were left at the scene. The ink seems to be new...

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1_o0]
Hmm... Look closefully at the content of the manuscript

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2]
Flowered Path

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2_desc]
Somehow, the pillars including Star Swirl the Bearded has escaped from Canterlot and disappeared.
Recentyly, we found a flowered path in the suburbs, extending from the suburbs to the nearby forests, mountains or snowfields.
It is said that where Mistmane passed, flowers would bloom, so some ponies believe that this is a sign of the activity of the pillars...

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2_o0]
Hmm... Look closefully at the flowers

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3]
Deserted Mask

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3_desc]
Our patrol team found an abandoned mask, judging from the patterns and decorations, it seems to belong to the Meadowbrook the Pillar...
Mage Meadowbrook traveled around the world, saving the dying and healing the wounded, helping those sick little ponies. The personal items she left behind must be full of her love and blessings for all beings in the world...
But if it was abandoned by her... it may also be full of germs infected during the healing process... Eww...

[en.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3_o0]
To bless or to infect, that is the question...

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1]
尤里卡！

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1_desc]
不知是如何办到的，不久之前星璇等长老从坎特洛特越狱并随后失去踪迹。
小马们普遍认为长老已经不在了，但也有很多阴谋论者相信长老们依然存活并在秘密帮助小马和其他生物们对抗三巨头。总之，还没有小马见过他们。
但是就在几天前，我们发现了疑似星璇长老的踪迹，现场只有留下的一些手稿，墨迹似乎是新的...

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_1_o0]
唔...研究一下手稿的内容

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2]
花之路

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2_desc]
不知是如何办到的，不久之前星璇等长老从坎特洛特越狱并随后失去踪迹。
最近，我们在各个郊区都发现了呈带状的花朵，从郊区延伸到附近的森林、山中或者雪地。
小马中流传着雾鬃走过的地方会留下绽放的花朵的说法，因此有些小马认为这是雾鬃等长老活动的迹象...

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_2_o0]
唔...研究一下花朵

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3]
遗落的面具

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3_desc]
我们的巡逻队捡到了一个被遗弃的面具，从花纹和挂饰来看似乎是属于草甸青溪长老的...
草甸清溪法师游历于各国，救死扶伤，帮助那些身患重病的小马。她所遗留下来的贴身物品，想必都饱含着她对世界众生的热爱与祝福...
不过如果是被她丢弃的... 可能也饱含治病过程中沾染的病菌... 哕...

[zh.EVENT_UNIVERSAL_RANDOM_3_o0]
祝福还是感染，这是个问题...
